        "url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DcBeeEBJHw0/",
        "caption": "Still confused between Smoke Testing and Sanity Testing? 👀\n\nThey sound similar, but they answer two completely different questions.\n\n🔥 Smoke Testing:\n“Is this build stable enough to start testing?”\n\n🧠 Sanity Testing:\n“Did this specific change or bug fix actually work?”\n\nThink of it this way:\n\nNew build → Quick health check → Smoke Testing\n\nBug fix → Focused validation → Sanity Testing\n\nSmoke gives you confidence that the build is testable.\n\nSanity gives you confidence that a specific change is working as expected.\n\nSave this Reel so you don't mix them up again! 🚀\n\nWhich one did you find confusing when you first started testing? 👇\n\n#SoftwareTesting #QA #QualityAssurance #SmokeTesting #SanityTesting SoftwareTestingHacks TestingCommunity ManualTesting TestAutomation QualityEngineering",
